scription></item><item><title>U.S. rail carload and intermodal volume continues strong momentum in October, reports AAR</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/u-s-rail-carload-and-intermodal-volume-continues-strong-momentum-in-oc-116845f8d3/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/u-s-rail-carload-and-intermodal-volume-continues-strong-momentum-in-oc-116845f8d3/</guid><pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 16:41:51 +0000</pubDate><category>Industry</category><description>The Association of American Railroads said U.S. rail carload and intermodal volumes stayed strong in October, according to its latest Rail Industry Overview. The AAR said 15 of its 20 tracked carload commodity groups rose from a year earlier, and 16 were up on a year-to-date basis. Grain, petroleum and petroleum products, chemicals and metallic ores led the year-to-date gains. The report called October intermodal volume &quot;especially strong,&quot; citing the first, third and fifth-best intermodal weeks on record, and said 2026 is expected to set a new record. Cited drivers included high diesel prices, trucker insurance and maintenance costs, fewer available truck drivers and solid rail performance.</description></item><item><title>‘Chicago truck driver’ that killed mom and two young sons confirmed illegal alien</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/chicago-truck-driver-that-killed-mom-and-two-young-sons-confirmed-ille-59b5f8eb7d/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/chicago-truck-driver-that-killed-mom-and-two-young-sons-confirmed-ille-59b5f8eb7d/</guid><pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 16:19:08 +0000</pubDate><category>Industry</category><description>BizPac Review</description></item><item><title>Driver Qualification: Getting the hiring process right</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/driver-qualification-getting-the-hiring-process-right-97016c823e/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/driver-qualification-getting-the-hiring-process-right-9701